{"kind": "mod", "id": 1847, "name": "Skeleton Key", "slug": "skeleton-key", "teaser": "Adds two new items, \"Skeleton Key\" and \"Priority Keycard.\" Unlock any door in the Tarkov region.", "owner_name": "Boogle", "downloads": 32880, "favourites": 1, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:03:04.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-11-19T19:30:19.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-11-19T19:30:19.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.0.5", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p>Tired of bringing your Shoreline keys when you went to Customs? If so, this mod is for you.</p>\n<p>Adds two new keys which will open any door in the Tarkov region.</p>\n<p>Adds two new items:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Skeleton Key</strong></li>\n<li><strong>TerraGroup Labs priority access keycard</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Currently the only way to obtain them is to buy them from the flea market.<br />\n</strong></p>\n<p><strong>As of version 1.0.1, they now spawn in jackets &amp; bots (pockets &amp; bags), they are very rare.</strong></p>\n<p>The mod has a <strong>config file for adjusting the prices &amp; use count</strong>, but by default are very expensive. From a balancing POV, this mod is probably gonna break the game a bit.</p>\n<p>Have fun!</p>\n<p>If you have any problems or suggestions, feel free to leave a comment.</p>\n<p>If you want to just cheat them in the IDs are</p>\n<ul>\n<li>673e1f10aaf0fe810c488218</li>\n<li>673e213fc6be39d06423d6b7</li>\n</ul>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.9.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 2439, "published_at": "2024-11-20T17:05:41.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1847/skeleton-key/1.0